---
// Qwen3.5-Omni：Thinker-Talker 全模态架构（依据公开技术报告，示意图）
---
<figure>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 400" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <defs>
      <marker id="om-ar" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="6" refY="3" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0,0 L7,3 L0,6 Z" fill="#0e87a6"></path>
      </marker>
      <filter id="om-shadow" x="-20%" y="-20%" width="140%" height="160%">
        <feDropShadow dx="0" dy="2" stdDeviation="4" flood-color="#0b2a3a" flood-opacity="0.10"></feDropShadow>
      </filter>
    </defs>
    <g font-family="-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif" text-anchor="middle">
      <text x="300" y="24" font-size="14" font-weight="bold" fill="#0c5f74">Qwen3.5-Omni：Thinker-Talker 全模态架构（示意）</text>

      {/* 输入 */}
      <rect x="30" y="70" width="92" height="34" rx="8" fill="#eef2f8" stroke="#8fa4c9"></rect>
      <text x="76" y="92" font-size="10.5" fill="#334155">文本</text>
      <rect x="30" y="116" width="92" height="34" rx="8" fill="#f0fbf5" stroke="#7ec3a0"></rect>
      <text x="76" y="138" font-size="10.5" fill="#334155">图像 / 视频</text>
      <rect x="30" y="162" width="92" height="34" rx="8" fill="#fdf3ec" stroke="#e6a23c"></rect>
      <text x="76" y="184" font-size="10.5" fill="#334155">语音 / 音频</text>

      {/* 编码器 */}
      <rect x="150" y="92" width="100" height="40" rx="9" fill="#0f9d68" filter="url(#om-shadow)"></rect>
      <text x="200" y="110" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#fff">视觉编码器</text>
      <text x="200" y="124" font-size="9" fill="#d6f3e9">SigLIP2（分块）</text>
      <rect x="150" y="150" width="100" height="40" rx="9" fill="#e6a23c" filter="url(#om-shadow)"></rect>
      <text x="200" y="168" font-size="10.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#fff">音频编码器</text>
      <text x="200" y="182" font-size="9" fill="#fdecd4">AuT（~160ms/帧）</text>
      <line x1="122" y1="87" x2="148" y2="105" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#om-ar)"></line>
      <line x1="122" y1="133" x2="148" y2="120" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#om-ar)"></line>
      <line x1="122" y1="179" x2="148" y2="170" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#om-ar)"></line>

      {/* Thinker */}
      <rect x="286" y="78" width="150" height="150" rx="12" fill="#0e87a6" filter="url(#om-shadow)"></rect>
      <text x="361" y="104" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#fff">Thinker</text>
      <text x="361" y="124" font-size="9.5" fill="#dff3f9">Hybrid MoE 骨干</text>
      <text x="361" y="144" font-size="9.5" fill="#dff3f9">混合注意力 + Gated</text>
      <text x="361" y="158" font-size="9.5" fill="#dff3f9">DeltaNet（省 KV）</text>
      <text x="361" y="182" font-size="9.5" fill="#dff3f9">统一理解文/视/音</text>
      <text x="361" y="206" font-size="9.5" fill="#bfe6f2">ARIA 交错对齐</text>
      <line x1="250" y1="125" x2="284" y2="140" stroke="#0e87a6" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#om-ar)"></line>
      <line x1="250" y1="170" x2="284" y2="166" stroke="#0e87a6" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#om-ar)"></line>

      {/* Talker */}
      <rect x="470" y="110" width="110" height="86" rx="12" fill="#6d5bd0" filter="url(#om-shadow)"></rect>
      <text x="525" y="136" font-size="12.5" font-weight="bold" fill="#fff">Talker</text>
      <text x="525" y="154" font-size="9" fill="#e6e1fa">Hybrid MoE</text>
      <text x="525" y="170" font-size="9" fill="#e6e1fa">语音 token</text>
      <text x="525" y="186" font-size="9" fill="#e6e1fa">+ MTP 预测</text>
      <line x1="436" y1="153" x2="468" y2="153" stroke="#0e87a6" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#om-ar)"></line>

      {/* 输出 */}
      <rect x="470" y="220" width="110" height="30" rx="8" fill="#eef2f8" stroke="#8fa4c9"></rect>
      <text x="525" y="239" font-size="10" fill="#334155">文本回答</text>
      <rect x="470" y="258" width="110" height="30" rx="8" fill="#f4f0ff" stroke="#9b8ae0"></rect>
      <text x="525" y="277" font-size="9.5" fill="#5b4ba8">语音波形 Code2wav</text>
      <line x1="361" y1="228" x2="468" y2="234" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="4,3" marker-end="url(#om-ar)"></line>
      <line x1="525" y1="196" x2="525" y2="218" stroke="#9b8ae0" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#om-ar)"></line>
      <line x1="525" y1="250" x2="525" y2="256" stroke="#9b8ae0" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#om-ar)"></line>

      <text x="300" y="330" font-size="10.5" fill="#5b7a86">Thinker 统一多模态理解；Talker 负责流式语音表达，ARIA 让文本/语音同步，分块预填充降低首包延迟</text>
      <text x="300" y="352" font-size="9.5" fill="#94a3b8" text-anchor="middle">（依据 Qwen3.5-Omni 公开技术报告的示意结构，细节以官方为准）</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
</figure>
